153
00:08:58,014 --> 00:09:01,231
I wouldn't have to worry about
food or a place to sleep anymore?

154
00:09:01,314 --> 00:09:03,214
I accept, by all means!

155
00:09:03,694 --> 00:09:06,074
Ah, basically he'd be our patron.

156
00:09:06,814 --> 00:09:10,671
And Miss Audrey, if you would also
consider staying on as a public symbol,

157
00:09:10,754 --> 00:09:13,931
I can promise you three square
meals and a nap per day.

158
00:09:14,014 --> 00:09:18,031
Oh wow, you've gone and offered me
exactly the kind of reward I would want.

159
00:09:18,114 --> 00:09:21,290
That seriously calls to a
working adult's tired heart.

160
00:09:21,734 --> 00:09:24,381
But I don't know, what
do you think, Jinguji?

161
00:09:25,674 --> 00:09:28,811
I'm afraid I'm actually against it.

162
00:09:28,894 --> 00:09:30,371
Why though?

163
00:09:30,454 --> 00:09:33,711
Even if we don't do anything, we
get three square meals and a nap.

164
00:09:33,794 --> 00:09:35,951
That's what everyone can tell dreams of.

165
00:09:36,034 --> 00:09:38,269
I can't say I've ever dreamed of that.

166
00:09:39,194 --> 00:09:41,831
And his lordship didn't say
we wouldn't have to work.

167
00:09:41,914 --> 00:09:45,071
But he said I just have
to stay here. That's true.

168
00:09:45,154 --> 00:09:48,851
All you have to do is stay and
entertain the important people.

169
