180
00:10:20,294 --> 00:10:22,771
If we need a food taster,
we have schmarzzy!

181
00:10:22,854 --> 00:10:23,684
Wait, why me?

182
00:10:23,767 --> 00:10:27,531
Listen, all I know right now is that I
don't want to hike any more mountain paths!

183
00:10:27,614 --> 00:10:30,202
Oh, I mean, your reasons
do seem legitimate.

184
00:10:30,634 --> 00:10:33,987
His head's immersed in the
convenience of the modern era.

185
00:10:34,314 --> 00:10:35,354
Look, Tachiobana,

186
00:10:35,754 --> 00:10:39,754
I'm not opposed to strengthening
our pipeline to influential people.

187
00:10:39,894 --> 00:10:44,365
We're certain to obtain a fair amount
of useful information if we stay here.

188
00:10:44,634 --> 00:10:49,654
However, if we do stay, could we
still claim we're traveling freely?

189
00:10:50,534 --> 00:10:52,074
We have earned a break.

190
00:10:52,314 --> 00:10:54,271
We've been so busy with work and life.

191
00:10:54,354 --> 00:10:56,530
When's the last time we took it easy?

192
00:10:57,154 --> 00:11:00,251
Nobody's even watching us, so
why not kick back for once?

193
00:11:00,334 --> 00:11:01,411
It isn't logical,

194
00:11:01,494 --> 00:11:05,571
and I'm fully aware that there's an
obvious bias to my thoughts on this.

195
00:11:05,654 --> 00:11:07,811
I assume that has something
to do with how much

196
00:11:07,894 --> 00:11:10,451
I've enjoyed this sense
of being on vacation,

197
00:11:10,534 --> 00:11:13,358
which is why I'm not ready
to accept this offer.

198
00:11:14,934 --> 00:11:15,764
Jinguuji.

199
00:11:17,314 --> 00:11:20,020
Well, what are your
thoughts on it, Tachibana?

200
00:11:20,994 --> 00:11:25,465
Well, if you're gonna put it that way,
there's not much I can say, is there?

201
00:11:27,634 --> 00:11:29,594
Okay, bye! Thanks for everything!

202
00:11:34,074 --> 00:11:37,662
Thankfully, I was finally able
to obtain a map of this world.

203
00:11:39,134 --> 00:11:42,051
It'll take two weeks to get
to the royal capital, right?

204
00:11:42,134 --> 00:11:43,594
I don't wanna walk!

205
00:11:44,754 --> 00:11:47,048
If we'd done exactly as that lord said,

206
00:11:47,134 --> 00:11:50,016
