what you meant by that.

216
00:12:16,494 --> 00:12:19,114
Okay, let's go to the royal capital.

217
00:12:29,094 --> 00:12:31,294
Did you see what I saw?

218
00:12:31,954 --> 00:12:34,307
Can we just decide to pretend we didn't?

219
00:12:40,194 --> 00:12:42,754
I had a dream about when I was little.

220
00:12:43,434 --> 00:12:45,787
In it, my vision was blurred with tears,

221
00:12:45,954 --> 00:12:49,307
so I'm guessing it might not
have been a very good dream.

222
00:12:51,974 --> 00:12:53,503
As I looked up at the sky,

223
00:12:53,934 --> 00:12:55,811
I saw the light lance
down through the trees

224
00:12:55,894 --> 00:12:58,776
and I remember the piercing
sound of the cicadas.

225
00:12:59,974 --> 00:13:01,131
And there was this guy.

226
00:13:01,214 --> 00:13:04,038
When was it when we first
started being friends?

227
00:13:05,414 --> 00:13:07,554
Are you ready to go now, Tachibana?

228
00:13:10,494 --> 00:13:12,788
Our elementary school composition book?

229
00:13:12,974 --> 00:13:14,798
That brings back some memories.

230
00:13:15,054 --> 00:13:15,884
Yeah,

231
00:13:15,967 --> 00:13:17,411
I just had a super weird dream about back

232
00:13:17,494 --> 00:13:19,791
when we were kids and
it made me remember it.

233
00:13:19,874 --> 00:13:21,094
Take a look at this.

234
00:13:21,754 --> 00:13:24,225
My dream was to turn into cellophane tape.

235
00:13:25,154 --> 00:13:27,507
Yes, that's right, I had forgotten that.

236
00:13:27,694 --> 00:13:30,812
It was so incomprehensible
it actually frightened me.

237
00:13:31,194 --> 00:13:33,951
But if you were choosing between
this and becoming a woman,

238
00:13:34,034 --> 00:13:35,951
I'd have preferred the cellophane tape.

239
00:13:36,034 --> 00:13:38,505
Probably would have been less complicated.

240
00:13:38,814 --> 00:13:40,871
Anyway, here, I want you to look at this.

241
00:13:40,954 --> 00:13:44,660
What would you take with you to
be stranded on a desert island?

242
00:13:44,974 --> 00:13:46,445
My name is written there.

243
00:13:46,654 --> 00:13:49,274
Uh-huh, and now I get what I was thinking.

244
00:13:49,694 --> 00:13:52,631
I didn't choose you because you
were the most powerful weapon.

245
00:13:52,714 --> 00:13:55,211
